            <div xml:id="m-79b32b41-c650-43a7-acee-1ff217ffd58e">
              <lg xml:id="m-3a7f382a-48b6-495b-a24c-23b8118df317">
                <l xml:id="m-9fb1b4ee-f870-4ea8-aa3b-12b38e100e75" facs="#m-4bb22467-c92a-4c4a-adc7-4d478a5cc48b" label="text-like">Nuptial Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-fcd7196d-5ef5-4e7f-ad4a-8e3c3827baaf" facs="#m-8a16719c-f2c2-4259-8c38-2c8d25852a51" label="ambiguous">1201</l><l xml:id="m-31f1fa8b-3653-41b1-a39c-20ec3400fc7e" facs="#m-837dfd43-2ea2-49da-9386-be6ea77560e5" label="lyrics-like">Dómi-nus</l><l xml:id="m-ff8b6081-2274-46ec-addb-16315f8ca9a0" facs="#m-38625b81-eb87-4d36-841f-88adf8c4dfaa" label="lyrics-like">ex Sí¬</l><l xml:id="m-05e94502-c1c8-40d1-ab18-574593b3765a" facs="#m-21e818b3-1a2d-4509-9e39-4bb39a5bf19a" label="ambiguous">cit</l><l xml:id="m-30cfea34-466d-49ac-966f-23ae7f57c4cc" facs="#m-e0053bf1-9fcd-4b7f-85f3-5142b8016fb0" label="lyrics-like">on: qui fé¬</l><l xml:id="m-836c922b-a282-43d3-9095-d2121e5b8f89" facs="#m-02bba497-c8e9-4f56-b0d2-e2a7ae409fb3" label="lyrics-like">lum* et térram.</l><l xml:id="m-765701af-7ad1-4d9f-87f6-c6a583214bb9" facs="#m-6837e9dc-56bd-4caa-8872-a91cf674c930" label="lyrics-like">caé¬</l><l xml:id="m-c45115f7-4c6b-4318-a210-15da41033da2" facs="#m-b15191e6-4f03-46dd-9a58-4c38e1b89e8e" label="ambiguous">4 Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 19</l><l xml:id="m-c72ed942-28d7-4196-b5d1-ead653bc9fad" facs="#m-6a9c8100-f0b1-495c-ae79-c78381f3ba9a" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Accessérunt ad eos? Et dixit: Propter hoc dimittet</l><l xml:id="m-e873be6e-1fe6-4914-897c-4f6d4a20f16b" facs="#m-c38f557e-f97f-460d-9af2-e32829b29774" label="lyrics-like">L Jesum Pharisaéi tentántes eum,</l><l xml:id="m-88a990ae-c052-4cc7-8073-483953a48af4" facs="#m-7da0838c-7f7b-4b76-bdcf-0b25549e07d5" label="ambiguous">homo patrem et matrem, et adhae¬</l><l xml:id="m-38beaa91-7216-42b1-b6c7-8d13fdabafe7" facs="#m-68b940e1-5fd8-4cfc-ac3e-1d6d02f18f43" label="lyrics-like">rébit uxóri suae, et erunt duo in</l><l xml:id="m-ce03d811-f6a0-4d06-bdf6-f46e8d802549" facs="#m-ae2836b9-4be7-4031-9598-c52fd41499fc" label="lyrics-like">et dicéntes: Si licet hómini dimit¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ca83e73-d3eb-48a6-8130-df19aa2c893e" facs="#m-997f972d-7060-4da1-9792-a12a55e06001" label="ambiguous">carne una. Itaque jam non sunt</l><l xml:id="m-9b997ec0-b068-4b32-9dd1-60054c6b46ad" facs="#m-c1d75c53-8e8b-4275-a170-b1b4d52d353a" label="lyrics-like">tere uxórem suam, quacúmque ex</l><l xml:id="m-bc31fc02-eaf6-4f42-b406-2427028fe31b" facs="#m-83a3b7e7-54ad-4c93-8410-e2d9d3af8fb0" label="ambiguous">duo, sed una caro. Quod ergo Deus</l><l xml:id="m-58526219-eaa4-49fa-baaf-ca3af39252fe" facs="#m-52dd0a2c-46ef-48c9-af7b-01431b0eb452" label="lyrics-like">causa? Qui respóndens, ait eis : Non</l><l xml:id="m-7f8f37ed-9a6b-4a7f-b56b-4160c2351c2b" facs="#m-818cf738-dd2f-4500-b287-c60ca805ed43" label="lyrics-like">legístis, quia qui fecit hóminem ab conjúnxit, homo non séparet.</l><l xml:id="m-8db41f61-e2ff-439a-8135-ad5db6ecfceb" facs="#m-da6e9333-4cd7-4173-8281-6f4d0f8ca9d3" label="lyrics-like">instio, mãsculum et féminam fecit</l><l xml:id="m-2f8ef55e-1fd6-461b-8b6b-dbfc0be3e6e9" facs="#m-bb14dacd-4105-499e-959a-8202b81a4dce" label="lyrics-like">offertory. In te sperávi. p. 1035. (T. P. Allelúia. p. 96.)</l><l xml:id="m-6e7e6335-4350-4497-b6fb-29465a740ec9" facs="#m-2c8e97e7-8471-4c9d-80b7-a5ddbefd01f2" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-76736f7e-1300-47c2-b2e4-5494c2f9c589" facs="#m-99d20d96-501b-429b-803c-cb507d55437c" label="lyrics-like">NUscipe, quaésumus Dómine, pro tum: et cujus largítor es óperis,</l><l xml:id="m-855b49ab-c683-4cd8-b990-655253595ef3" facs="#m-be67e37b-6d17-4ab1-9169-471f67490c24" label="lyrics-like">O sacra connúbii lege munus óblá¬lesto dispósitor. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-0419fc07-15cf-4410-9f0e-1934f7ecb84f" facs="#m-6fe771ce-838d-4c54-9801-0dfc1d534e47" label="text-like">After the Pater noster. the Priest goes to the Epistle side of the altar and.</l><l xml:id="m-5678097f-9afa-4b4c-8369-284a248be67a" facs="#m-a5952db8-d767-478d-8ac6-8a8901e1281e" label="text-like">turning towards the Bride and Bridegroom who are kneeling at the altar</l><l xml:id="m-4cc831c0-0ebd-4374-9f1f-bb80b19850d9" facs="#m-fdfe8724-46c5-48bd-b7f2-e9545e6f5fcd" label="text-like">steps, says the following prayers over them.</l><l xml:id="m-6fbc7596-c2da-40a6-a6d2-d5f724c25a21" facs="#m-8d4ac4ec-330d-43d9-86d1-cd48eb1dcdb0" label="ambiguous">Prayers.</l><l xml:id="m-51043c75-aaa3-4ad6-b968-d4655c6b0bd0" facs="#m-856e541f-97b6-4f27-a71a-0aa1005ed323" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-ab08ec07-9f10-4cc7-a968-935aa037053c" facs="#m-202a2a9b-8766-4751-9355-1dc19b29489f" label="lyrics-like">ORopitiáre Dómine supplicatió- neris ordinásti, benignus assiste;</l><l xml:id="m-67004e2d-fa9e-40a0-a89f-5d1a12d1a3c9" facs="#m-3f72785b-016e-4159-8e0f-71a425170ee4" label="lyrics-like">ut, quod te auctóre júngitur, te au¬</l><l xml:id="m-4eba74a4-d33d-4362-a58e-5d19412db41d" facs="#m-7fbc60c8-6cfd-4bb3-9b8e-b5be64ffab76" label="lyrics-like">L nibus nostris; et institútis tuis,</l><l xml:id="m-354f2549-705c-45dd-bb9b-0da609213d88" facs="#m-7de2c56c-05bc-4f7c-9537-32a44d6f789f" label="lyrics-like">quibus propagatiónem humáni gé-l xiliánte servétur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-f782e871-7660-4070-9032-680590ede228" facs="#m-37271713-9eb3-4eda-8618-d04a7d9ce067" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-23bad88b-0244-4428-bd9a-b2e8131f204b" facs="#m-31670ad9-4ea3-41d1-bbf2-f7090af344f7" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui potestáte virtútis tuae, signáres in foédere nuptiárum</l><l xml:id="m-5301bfb2-cd89-450d-8068-307b3ee56c3b" facs="#m-b8c0a0bc-1d8c-429e-a111-43867f999d4c" label="lyrics-like">Deus, per quem múlier júngitur</l><l xml:id="m-244b3594-1837-4c2c-8694-2f7fe9411349" facs="#m-f1afb4fe-1d4a-45c8-b4a4-c18f7860fdcf" label="ambiguous">de nihilo cuncta fecisti: qui.</l><l xml:id="m-402cbaa3-a762-44c1-a213-1ce7ee68a9dc" facs="#m-dc879e43-764f-4457-a5f5-1c3b625c4b94" label="lyrics-like">viro, et societas principáliter ordi¬</l><l xml:id="m-698a6ea6-ad07-4a20-9579-bd8156f33d6b" facs="#m-923e3f87-b117-499a-9912-26b07193e014" label="lyrics-like">dispósitis universitátis exórdiis, hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-622e145f-fb5e-4325-8db4-751a39ea9149" facs="#m-a24dcaf6-854b-4641-951e-1c1243555695" label="lyrics-like">náta, ea benedictióne donátur, quae</l><l xml:id="m-020ebe45-691e-4184-aacf-5fb12cf110d1" facs="#m-8d0d34c6-8726-4604-9e22-bf9d4bd3861f" label="lyrics-like">mini ad imáginem Dei facto. Ideo</l><l xml:id="m-1ea7fb20-f10f-437b-bfcb-cc36fec06314" facs="#m-e93f8dca-cedd-42e8-a947-1550652da818" label="lyrics-like">sola nec per originális peccáti poe¬</l><l xml:id="m-d843254f-6586-490f-afe3-6f15e77777f5" facs="#m-88555575-6002-48cf-aee7-4646878b0e37" label="lyrics-like">inseparábile mulieris adjutórium</l><l xml:id="m-d0ce1a4c-c371-45a5-ae82-73bddcfa9202" facs="#m-b03f124a-10d0-4889-b0e1-1c2d8a27d390" label="lyrics-like">nam, nec per dilúvii est abláta sen¬</l><l xml:id="m-ce967878-3312-42d9-858d-71825f5f0f1a" facs="#m-07d9ef12-89a9-470c-ae4b-d874ed499df7" label="lyrics-like">condidisti, ut femineo córpori de</l><l xml:id="m-cbd66ac0-c544-45a8-a89f-0309e956c3f1" facs="#m-e2c9a2ff-544b-4ba4-85ff-a6cd4da629dc" label="lyrics-like">téntiam: réspice propítius super</l><l xml:id="m-081fd1ad-b5eb-4b97-9516-d37add083359" facs="#m-626e4710-3ceb-4a0c-b1ec-1a4b162c498e" label="ambiguous">virili dares carne principium, docens</l><l xml:id="m-078932e6-0cfa-43a6-8607-4da272b9d418" facs="#m-1b5eccb4-f618-487d-b68e-f2981c57dc8b" label="lyrics-like">hanc fámulam tuam, quae maritáli</l><l xml:id="m-ef6c47a0-9b4a-4e6d-9ba5-bee48bd4b836" facs="#m-be224c61-39a2-4077-beb5-c3bedb6c1b02" label="ambiguous">quod ex uno placuisset institui,</l><l xml:id="m-3fdce14f-81b1-4115-b2c1-73fef1f97429" facs="#m-96046393-ee1d-4dcc-83f0-c0bf144723a8" label="lyrics-like">jungénda consórtio, tua se éxpetit</l><l xml:id="m-a3a8edef-983f-4980-9ac1-8a12f9e4fda3" facs="#m-462716f6-f6cd-4bf5-b306-e67dbbb5504d" label="lyrics-like">numquam licére disjúngi: Deus,</l><l xml:id="m-3f766f38-85b2-4ba7-851b-4dc9f017df5a" facs="#m-fa6ec93f-83d5-4b3b-8614-232176fa0d72" label="lyrics-like">protectióne muniri : sit in ea jugum</l><l xml:id="m-7a033ef9-8ced-4922-b3cb-977b325272fc" facs="#m-640a8a57-6cad-4e23-9e04-0081316da52f" label="lyrics-like">qui tam excellénti mystério conju¬</l><l xml:id="m-621111ec-72bb-4374-a96b-91ad8790b25c" facs="#m-8ed9816f-4faa-4f5a-a9a8-94575dbd093d" label="lyrics-like">dilectiónis et pacis: fidélis et casta</l><l xml:id="m-0034330c-7d41-4dfc-a00d-994466e6b05b" facs="#m-08c8dcf3-166b-4d2f-8fa0-e9ea5ffd2246" label="lyrics-like">gálem cópulam consecrásti, ut Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-79bc7840-1780-4603-9a7c-c3c0060e5165" facs="#m-f68ea4e3-e1d3-4073-b76b-4a03599cd37b" label="lyrics-like">sti et Ecclésiae sacraméntum prae- nubat in Christo, imitatrixque san¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>